        {
          "text": " Ira MUKAMA akaba akwetsire omuzeituuni murungi oguyumbize, kandi ogwine ebijuma birungi, mwenu ahabw'okuhoorera kw'omuyaga mwingi aryagwotsya, amataagi gaagwo gasiriire. ",
