              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA ow'amahe owaakubyaire, akucwereire orubanja rw'okuhikwaho akabi, naakutura ebibi ebi enju ya Israeli n'eya Yuda baakozire, bakangwisa kubi ahabw'okwoterera Baali obubaane.",
