              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habure owaarokokaho; ahabw'okuba ndyareeta akabi ahari abo bantu b'omuri Anatoosi omu mwaka ogu barifubirirwamu.",
          "type": "text",
